<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria G.Cappa hlf-yr '96 profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigeria G.Cappa hlf-yr '96 profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year result for construction company G. Cappa Nigeria Plc to end-September 1996 (In million naira)</p>
<p>						    1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover					1,500  vs 682.6</p>
<p>Profit before taxation		     84.6  vs  32.5</p>
<p>Taxation					 25.3  vs  11.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation		     59.2  vs   21.1</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
